{
  "schema": 1,
  "id": "av1-obu-reading",
  "gate": "required",
  "operation": "av1-obu-reading",
  "candidate": "framing-views-worker",
  "worker_operation": "obu-",
  "runner": "cargo xtask report",
  "reference": "ffmpeg-framing-views-native",
  "contract": [
    "Read every temporal unit in its AV1 IVF envelope. The candidate drives the incremental OBU reader at the stated window size. The reference submits the complete temporal unit to filter_units with an excluded type absent from the unit, then reads the public wire syntax of its output. The filter may inspect OBU contents.",
    "Fold kind 1 with temporal unit index, OBU type, extension presence, temporal and spatial IDs (zero when absent), size presence, payload length and every payload byte. Fold kind 7 with the temporal unit index and OBU count on clean end or kind 8 with the index on refusal. An empty low-overhead unit carries zero OBUs.",
    "IVF envelope loading and parsing are outside the operation. Reader or filter construction, all units and teardown are inside."
  ],
  "required_profiles": [
    "authored-low-overhead",
    "authored-single",
    "encoded-authored",
    "fate"
  ],
  "required_targets": [
    "aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu",
    "thumbv7neon-unknown-linux-gnueabihf"
  ],
  "iterations": 50,
  "minimum_pairs": 30,
  "confidence": 0.95,
